@baseUrl = http://localhost:5147

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a wallet (stores the new wallet's id in {{walletId}} for the requests below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user_{{$random.integer(10000, 99999)}}",
  "currency": "EUR"
}

> {% client.global.set("walletId", response.body.id); %}

### Get a wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}

### Top up
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/top-ups
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Withdraw
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{walletId}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "amount": 30,
  "currency": "EUR"
}
